<div class="hero-section py-5 service-page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center min-vh-50">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 52px); line-height: 1.15;">
          Zofi Cash Salary Advance (EWA) Platform
        </h1>
        <p class="lead fw-semibold mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(18px, 2.3vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 980px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
          Real-time accrual, instant payouts, and automated payroll settlement
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0" style="font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 18px); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 980px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);">
          An Earned Wage Access (EWA) platform that calculates safe-to-withdraw wages in real time and integrates directly with employer payroll—eliminating manual reconciliation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="inner-sections">
  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="large-para mb-0">
          Employees in emerging markets often face liquidity gaps between paychecks, leading to predatory loans. Employers lacked a secure way to offer salary advances without
          creating a manual accounting nightmare or risking payroll discrepancies.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The Solution</h2>
        <p class="large-para mb-0">
          We built a full-stack EWA platform that computes <strong>accrued but unpaid wages</strong> in real time and supports instant withdrawals to mobile wallets or bank accounts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Technical Approach</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>Accrual Engine:</strong> Tracks hours worked vs. rate to compute a “Safe-to-Withdraw” limit and prevent overdrafts.</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Payroll Adjustment:</strong> Generates settlement files that plug into payroll/ERP so advances are deducted before final payroll runs.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Technical Details</h2>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Architecture</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">Flutter (Mobile) → Node.js (Microservices) → PostgreSQL</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Integrations</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">Mobile Money (M-Pesa/MTN), Plaid (bank verification), and custom ERP connectors (SAP/Oracle).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Security</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">MFA, AES-256 encryption for payroll data, and strict KYC/AML verification flows.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">AI Features</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">Credit risk scoring adjusts advance limits using historical withdrawal and repayment patterns.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Results &amp; Impact</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>10,000+</strong> active users accessing liquidity instantly.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero</strong> manual intervention required from HR/Payroll teams.</li>
          <li><strong>98%</strong> repayment rate via automated at-source deductions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-3 pb-3 d-inline-block">Ready to build something similar?</h2>
        <p class="lead mb-4">We’ll design your payout + payroll settlement flows for correctness, auditability, and scale.</p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/ahmadkamran/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-5 me-2 mb-2">
          Schedule a Technical Discovery Call
        </a>
        <%= link_to "View our Services", root_path(anchor: "services"), class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-5 mb-2 ajax" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

